; Change a form, or add one.
FORM FORM_EDIT
TITLE Change a form
SUMMARY Changes the template behind a form, or adds a new one. It takes effect at once. FORM_RESET puts a form back as it came.
ORDER 95
ACTION form_template_put
PREFILL template template
FIELD template Form(XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX) required upper as=form
FIELD text Template(TEXT) required
BEGIN_HELP
Form:
The form to change, as form_list names it. A new name adds a form.
END

Template:
The template as text. docs/forms.md has the lines a template can hold.
END
